      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET PARIS (1) turned spotting a big start finishing fifth (30.39) last time in a Grade 5/6 at this track. Solid record here winning two races. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. INVESTED (4) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 1.75 lengths from the winner Charos Finale (17.49) at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Well placed and gets his chance. SHINBONER SMOKEY (2) settled close to the lead but collided in the run and turned spotting a start, finishing fourth (17.76) at this track over 297m in a LS6. Gets chance to atone. SHINBONER PIXIE (7) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
